{
  "_comment": "Hook order observed from real `claude` 2.1.280 turns (interactive and -p). Each step: the hook, the terminal-status-update the receiver emits for it, and the agent state the frontend resolves. A silent turn has no event between UserPromptSubmit and Stop.",
